  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">2026-04-13</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-11" contextRef="c-1">Q4</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-12" contextRef="c-1">2026-04-13</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-13" contextRef="c-1">Q4</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-14" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Use this space to paste or type in any Important Changes During the Quarter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:252%"&gt;1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:252%;padding-left:9.56pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:252%"&gt;2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:252%;padding-left:9.56pt"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.56pt"&gt;Previously, in 4Q 2020, Chisholm Pipeline Company no longer had sufficient volumes to warrant continued service on existing routes. All tariffs were cancelled per Docket IS21-043-000 in compliance with the provisions of 18 CFR &#167; 341.5 (Cancellation of tariffs). Chisholm Pipeline ceased service, purged and idled the pipeline with final barrels delivered to inventory owners in February 2021. A change in demand has allowed Chisholm Pipeline Company to restart service in March of 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:126%"&gt;4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:126%;padding-left:9.56pt"&gt;The Company is involved in various litigation arising from the normal operations of its pipeline business. The Company, based on the advice of counsel, believes that any adverse findings with respect to such legal actions will not result in a material effect on the financial position of the Company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:118%"&gt;5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:118%;padding-left:9.56pt"&gt;Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-15" contextRef="c-1">2026-04-13</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-16" contextRef="c-1">Q4</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-17" contextRef="c-1">2026-04-13</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-18" contextRef="c-1">Q4</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-19" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:115%"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Chisholm Pipeline Company (Company) is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission ("FERC"). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements generally conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:115%"&gt;Pipeline Operator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Respondent has no employees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;Respondent's properties are operated by Phillips 66 Pipeline LLC as agent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
