  <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.56pt">Previously, in 4Q 2020, Chisholm Pipeline Company no longer had sufficient volumes to warrant continued service on existing routes. All tariffs were cancelled per Docket IS21-043-000 in compliance with the provisions of 18 CFR &#167; 341.5 (Cancellation of tariffs). Chisholm Pipeline ceased service, purged and idled the pipeline with final barrels delivered to inventory owners in February 2021. A change in demand has allowed Chisholm Pipeline Company to restart service in March of 2024.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Schedule 102, Column ( c ), Line 2 Note: Chisholm Pipeline Holdings, LLC, DE is owned by ONEOK Partners LP., DE which is owned by ONEOK, Inc., DE</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Schedule 602, Column ( a ), Line 1</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Chisholm Pipeline Company in section (A) column (a) line 1 is the owner of the pipeline reported. Respondent&#8217;s properties are operated by Phillips 66 Pipeline LLC as agent (not lessee)</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
